[node name="HelpText" type="RichTextLabel" parent="HelpOverlay/CenterContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=703724739]
unique_name_in_owner = true
layout_mode = 2
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[b] WHAT THIS IS[/b]
A CHIP-8 emulator! Or rather interpereter. The CHIP-8 in 1977 had only FOUR kilobytes of RAM, 16 registers, and a 64x32 screen! Real antique, right? 

Pick a cartridge down there and play!

[b]KEYPAD[/b]   CHIP-8 -> keyboard
  1 2 3 C              1 2 3 4
  4 5 6 D              Q W E R
  7 8 9 E              A S D F
  A 0 B F              Z X C V


[b]EMULATOR[/b]
  P   pause / resume     Esc  reset cartridge
  N   step 1 instruction M    step 1 frame
  O   open a ROM file    F1   this screen
  B    hold to rewind recent gameplay! 
  Drag a .ch8 file onto the window to play it."
fit_content = true

[node name="PowerButton" type="Button" parent="HelpOverlay/CenterContainer/VBoxContainer" unique_id=1637095342]
